(text "AO SUPPLY VAO 16.1 V  -  DC-DC (decision #37)" (at 21.59 23.368 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 4b025b37-b1ec-5592-bbdf-0891cf1ad1e1))
(text "VAO = 0.8 V x (1 + 422k/22.1k) = 16.08 V (15.5-16.6 V). LMR51606 FPWM 1.1 MHz, max duty 98 %." (at 21.59 69.596 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 07bd1486-8589-55b6-a0c1-91fe29fe449b))
(text "Load 2 x (DAC 27 + OPA197 1.3 + TPS26611 1.75 mA) = 60 mA. C46/C56 at U9/U10 pin 6." (at 21.59 73.152 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 6cb2c44e-ffba-5487-aac1-2082effa3a6f))
(text "VIN_P < ~17 V: VAO follows VIN_P (dropout). 24 mA x 500 ohm OK down to VIN ~15.8 V." (at 21.59 76.708 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 2394327c-4c10-56c9-b921-a09a2fcb198b))
(text "SUPPLY MONITOR" (at 186.69 25.908 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 4ea3d59c-8d1f-5237-9914-5276aad9c0c9))
