(text "  from about 0.66 W to 0.39 W per channel (24 mA short, any supply 12-28 V)." (at 21.59 102.108 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a8405aaf-71c5-5430-8114-8dd75b7f44ab))
(text "  Thermal test on a potted prototype still planned." (at 21.59 107.696 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid dcec0a3e-56b1-5cad-b4f5-8c55aabe913b))
(text "HSE crystal: no room next to PF0/PF1 -> factory HSI trim + firmware HSI calibration" (at 21.59 113.284 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e8fbd2cd-1f8b-5625-9d1a-0fed3f14eb08))
(text "  from Modbus frame timing (USART auto-baud / timer capture)." (at 21.59 118.872 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid fd2a83b2-238a-5f2d-a763-2697e408ccf9))
