(text "  if needed: protect at the HTX99R side or in the next PCB rev." (at 21.59 130.048 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5549c12a-8cfe-5776-b0b0-643a3d2df322))
